<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/43/eng@/~cl_6__para_b> <https://schema.org/text> "by inserting after subsection (2) the following subsection: \"(3) All provisions relating to the Customs Appeal Tribunal shall be applicable to this Act.\". Saving and transitional"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/43/eng@> .
