<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/43/eng@/~cl_7__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "Any appeal under paragraph 50(2)(a) of the principal Act to the court made before the appointed date and is pending on such date shall, after the appointed date, be continued as if the principal Act had not been amended by this Act."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/43/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/43/eng@/~cl_7__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/43/eng@/~cl_7> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/43/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/43/eng@/~cl_7__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "3" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2006/43/eng@> .
